<title>HUNGARY: Hungary prelim Jan-Aug 96 Trade gap $1.767 billion.</title>
<headline>Hungary prelim Jan-Aug 96 Trade gap $1.767 billion.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's accumulated trade deficit was $1.767 billion in January to August 1996, compared with $1.934 billion for the same period last year, preliminary figures released by the National Bank of Hungary on Wednesday showed.</p>
<p>The NBH said the trade gap widened by $329 million in August.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom ++ 36 1 327 4040</p>
